{
  "job_C54_20251003_115322": {
    "text": "\u00dee.\nGe audiens.\n\u00deet.\n\u00deersib.\nGebiddan for.\nUre feder \u00feu eart in heofenum se is gehalgad \u00fein noma to cyme \u00fein rice sie willa \u00fein swe in heofenum\nHlaf ur deghweamlice sele us to deg panem nostrum cotidianum da nobis hodie.\n& forgef us scylda ussa swe & us forgef scylde ure et dimitte nobis debita nostra, sicut et nos\n& nu is in l\u00e6de in costunge ales us from yfele et ne nos inducas in temtationem, sed libera nos a\nPetrus cwe\u00fe ic gelefu on god feder almahtigne andre cwe\u00fe on h\u00e6lende crit sunu his on ancendan\nCwe\u00f0 iohennas, cwe\u00f0 philippus, cwe\u00f0 bartholomeus, cwe\u00f0 tomas, cwe\u00f0 matheus, cwe\u00f0 iacobus,\nGebletsad \u00feu eart se me no segon \u00fea gelefdon Beatus es, qui me non uidisti et credidisti.\nGod almahtig & drihten ur h\u00e6lend Christus & se halga gast gehald me on dege on n\u00e6hte lichoman\nBletsa me drihten & gehald me eteaw \u00fe\u00ebm drihten his onsiene me & gemildsige me Benedicat me\nGecer drihten ondwlite his to me & sele me sibbe & h\u00e6lo swi swe conuertat dominus uultum suum\nMycla\u00fe mine saule drihten & gefih\u00f0 min gast in gode \u00feinre halwendan for\u00feon geloca\u00fe\nSih\u00fee so\u00felice of \u00feissum eadige me cweo\u00f0a\u00f0 alle cneorissa for\u00feon dyde me micel \u00feu m\u00e6htig eart &\nDyde m\u00e6htige on his earme tostenc\u00f0 oferhydge mode his heorte fecit potentiam in brachio suo,\nHe asette \u00f0a m\u00e6htiggan of setle & up hof \u00fea eadmodan deposuit potentes de sede et exaltauit\n\u00dea hyngriendan gefylle\u00f0 mid godum & \u00fea weolan forlet idelhende esurientes impleuit bonis et\nHe onfeong israhel his cniht wes gemyndig wes his mildheortnisse swe he wes sprecende to urum\nGebletsung drihten god for\u00feon s\u00e6de & dyde alesnisse he gefylde & he us up rerde horn h\u00e6lo us in\n& lesse\u00fe us from urum feondum & from hodum allra \u00f0e us feodon to dege to donne mildheortnisse\n& \u00feu cniht bist gecged he witga geceged \u00feu forgonges so\u00felice \u00e6r onseone drihtnes gearwien his\nBletsiat alle werc drihtnes drihtne hergiat & ofer up hebba\u00f0 hine in weorulde Benedicite omnia\nBletsiat angela drihtnes drihtne herega\u00fe & ofer up hebba\u00fe hine in weorulde Benedicite angeli\nBletsiat heofenas drihtne herga\u00fe & ofer up hebba\u00fe hine in weoruld benedicite caeli, domino;\nBletsiat weter \u00fea \u00fee ofer heofenas sint drihtne herga\u00fe & ofer up hebba\u00fe hine in weoruld benedicite\nBletsiat alle megne benedicite omnes uirtutes domini, domino; laudate et superexaltate.\nBletsiat sunan & monan drihtne heregia\u00fe & ofer benedicite sol et luna, domino; laudate et\n\u00deet.\nOs alle ic gecege o on minne fultum Hos omnes inuocabo in auxilium meum.\nGeb mid allum sancta Maria semper uirgo, beata et gloriosa dei genetrix, intercede pro me cum\nSele me drihten \u00feines eges heortan Dona mihi, domine, timorem tuum, cordis conpunctionem.\nAlle so\u00felice Omnis autem recte quaesiuit, quem tu recte quaerere fecisti.\nAll ab omnibus absolue uinculis.\nBe \u00fe\u00e6m towea.\n\u00dea.\nIanuarius se mona bi\u00fe on\u00e6led et middre neht februarius se mona bi\u00fe on\u00e6led bi\u00fe on betwih middre\nNot in Zupitza sunu godes filius dei.\n\u00c6dig weoruld Beatus auctor s\u00e6culi.",
